# robohub-freertos Kconfig

menu "RoboHub FreeRTOS middleware"

config RH_FREERTOS
    bool "FreeRTOS OSAL"
    default n
    help
      FreeRTOS as the RoboHub OSAL: threads, millisecond delays and recursive
      mutexes. Linking this middleware replaces the weak bare-metal defaults
      robohub-core carries, and a program above it is unchanged — its periodic
      tasks become FreeRTOS tasks and its event bus locks for real.

endmenu
